        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "因此，迢迢生水贯穿天罡，不仅长兄毓秀，屈曲旺神归库，庆仲叔均荣。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
